# Regtest defaults match standard Nigiri: operator 7070, Esplora 30000.
# No environment file is required for that setup.
#
# For a custom deployment, copy this file to .env.local (gitignored), then
# uncomment and adjust the ports below. Values must be integers from 1 to 65535.
# These settings affect regtest only; the host remains http://localhost.
# The extension and test webapp share these settings.
#
# Example alternate local deployment:
# WXT_REGTEST_ARK_PORT=7071
# WXT_REGTEST_ESPLORA_PORT=30010
#
# Variables are embedded at build time, including production builds.
# Restart npm run dev / npm run test:webapp after editing, or rebuild and reload
# the extension. Build without local overrides when distributing default builds.
# WXT_ variables are public configuration, not a place to store secrets.
